WEBVTT

00:06:58.709 --> 00:07:05.029
But the magic is, if I multiply
my odd situations with my even behavior,

00:07:05.029 --> 00:07:07.630
with my positive behavior,

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:11.734
it gets me to better results,
to even results.

00:07:12.234 --> 00:07:16.438
And if one doesn't stop
when the situations are odd like this,

00:07:16.438 --> 00:07:20.580
if one keeps pushing himself,
keeps multiplying his blessings,

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.788
keeps multiplying his skills,

00:07:22.788 --> 00:07:26.680
even though the beginning is,
the end will never be odd.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.578
Wow, so once I got to know this,